  (text "Notes\nU6: PMODE[2:0] internal pull-ups = all capable, auto-negotiation; RSVD pin 23 to ground, RSVD 38-42 NC; VBG open. No auto-MDIX: the I/O board's LAN8742A does HP auto-MDIX, so a straight cable works\nC51: one per AVDD pin\nC52: one per AVDD pin\nC53: one per AVDD pin\nC54: one per AVDD pin\nC55: one per AVDD pin\nC56: one per AVDD pin\nC57: VDD pin 28\nY4: own crystal, CL 18 pF, +/-30 ppm (W5500 datasheet); separate from the MCU's HSE"
    (at 15.24 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a1b35312-2db7-5c9a-b220-b6ab15e11a75)
  )
  (text "\nC60: W5500 reference circuit\nR62: W5500 reference circuit\nR63: drive-level option, W5500 reference circuit\nR51: series, at the MCU\nR52: series, at the MCU\nC64: TX centre tap\nJ3: I/O boards only; silkscreen I/O ONLY\nR60: link LED; W5500 LED outputs sink (active low)\nR61: activity LED"
    (at 210.82 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 38c612ca-724f-5928-addb-7423dc20747c)
  )

